        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Enigma Lounge</strong> is a hand-pixeled, point-and-click escape room puzzle game set in a cozy yet quietly mysterious space. You find yourself locked inside a strange lounge filled with clues, hidden connections, and clever mechanisms waiting to be unraveled. The only way out is to solve the puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed as a compact, tightly crafted escape experience, <i>The Enigma Lounge</i> delivers a short but brain-twisting challenge that rewards curiosity and observation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔍 <strong>Explore a Single, Intricately Crafted Room</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire game takes place in one richly detailed environment. Every object, note, lock, and symbol is intentionally placed and interconnected.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧩 <strong>Solve a Web of Interlocking Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open drawers, unlock locks, decode notes, find hidden messages, and follow the pathways between puzzles. Perfect for players who enjoy the feeling of piecing a whole room together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎧 <strong>Atmospheric Sound &amp; Cozy Mystery Vibes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in gentle ambient audio, soft music, and subtle sound cues that bring this strange lounge to life. Relaxing, but with just enough mystery to keep you on edge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⭐ <strong>A Small, Satisfying Escape Room Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Enigma Lounge is built to be:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short but challenging</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy yet mysterious</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compact but thoughtfully designed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ideal for an evening puzzle session</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy escape rooms, clever clues, and hand-crafted pixel art, step inside the lounge and see if you can find your way back out.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Enigma Lounge</strong> is a hand-pixeled, point-and-click escape room puzzle game set in a cozy yet quietly mysterious space. You find yourself locked inside a strange lounge filled with clues, hidden connections, and clever mechanisms waiting to be unraveled. The only way out is to solve the puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed as a compact, tightly crafted escape experience, <i>The Enigma Lounge</i> delivers a short but brain-twisting challenge that rewards curiosity and observation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔍 <strong>Explore a Single, Intricately Crafted Room</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire game takes place in one richly detailed environment. Every object, note, lock, and symbol is intentionally placed and interconnected.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧩 <strong>Solve a Web of Interlocking Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open drawers, unlock locks, decode notes, find hidden messages, and follow the pathways between puzzles. Perfect for players who enjoy the feeling of piecing a whole room together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎧 <strong>Atmospheric Sound &amp; Cozy Mystery Vibes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in gentle ambient audio, soft music, and subtle sound cues that bring this strange lounge to life. Relaxing, but with just enough mystery to keep you on edge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⭐ <strong>A Small, Satisfying Escape Room Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Enigma Lounge is built to be:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short but challenging</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy yet mysterious</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compact but thoughtfully designed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ideal for an evening puzzle session</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy escape rooms, clever clues, and hand-crafted pixel art, step inside the lounge and see if you can find your way back out.</p>",
